hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1064","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak Aap hamein bhejtay hain to ham kisi qaum ke paas utartay hain aur wo hamari mehmaan nawazi nahi kartay, to Aap ki kya rai hai? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham se farmaya: Agar tum kisi qaum ke paas utro aur wo tumharay liye wo muqarrar karein jo mehmaan ke liye munasib hai to qabool karo, aur agar wo aisa na karein to un se mehmaan ka wo haq le lo jo un ke liye munasib hai. (Muslim: 5/138). Baab: Mehmaan nawazi ka hukm."
"1065","[AI-translation] Abu Shuraih Khuza'i (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mehmaan nawazi teen din hai, aur us ka inaam aik din aur aik raat hai, aur kisi Musalman mard ke liye halal nahi ke wo apne bhai ke paas itna thahray ke usay gunah mein daal de. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo usay gunah mein kaisay daalay ga? Farmaya: Us ke paas thahra rahay aur us ke paas kuch na ho jis se wo us ki mehmaan nawazi karay. (Muslim: 5/138). Baab: Zaaid maal se hamdardi."
"1066","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik safar mein thay ke aik aadmi apni sawari par aaya, unhon ne kaha: Wo apni nigahein daaein baaein phirnay laga (apni hajat ka samaan talb kartay hue), to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas sawaar honay (ke janwar) mein se zaaid ho wo usay de jis ke paas sawari nahi, aur jis ke paas zaad-e-raah mein se zaaid ho wo usay de jis ke paas zaad-e-raah nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne maal ki (mukhtalif) qisamon ka zikr kiya jo Aap ne zikr kiya, yahan tak ke ham ne samjha ke ham mein se kisi ka zaaid (maal) mein koi haq nahi. (Muslim: 5/138-139). Baab: Jab zaad-e-raah kam ho jaye to usay jama karnay aur us mein hamdardi ka hukm."
"1067","[AI-translation] Iyas bin Salama se, apne walid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik ghazwa mein niklay to hamein sakht mushqat pahunchee yahan tak ke ham ne irada kiya ke apni baaz sawariyan zibah kar dein, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukm diya to ham ne apni toshay daniyan jama keen aur Aap ke liye chamray ka dastar khwan bichaya, to qaum ka zaad-e-raah us dastar khwan par jama ho gaya. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne (us ka) andaza laganay ke liye gardan lambi ki ke wo kitna hai, to main ne andaza lagaya ke wo baithi hui bakri ke jism jitna hai, aur ham chaudah sau thay. Unhon ne kaha: To ham ne khaya yahan tak ke ham sab sair ho gaye, phir ham ne apni thailiyan bhar leen. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya wuzu ka (pani) hai? Unhon ne kaha: To aik aadmi apni choti mashkiza le kar aaya jis mein thora sa pani tha, to us ne usay aik pyalay mein undela, to ham sab ne us se wuzu kiya, ham chaudah sau thay, ham usay khoob khoob baha kar (istemal kartay hue) thay. Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ke baad aath (aadmi) aaye aur unhon ne kaha: Kya taharat ka (pani) hai? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wuzu (ka pani) khatm ho gaya. (Muslim: 5/139)"
